    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting yourself stop running\"? i'm already at my limit. i've worked double shifts, i've cut everything out, and it still isn't enough. it feels like there's no \"different kind of peace\" that doesn't involve just... disappearing. how is that even possible when everything is so tied to just surviving?",
